{
  "id": 8860456452295,
  "title": "Personalized Brown Hair Girl Reading with Wildflowers Throw Blanket",
  "handle": "personalized-brown-hair-girl-reading-with-wildflowers-throw-blanket",
  "body_html": "<p>Wrap yourself in comfort with this personalized blanket, designed especially for book lovers. This unique and thoughtful blanket from Jeminise is perfect for adding a touch of warmth and style to any reading nook, making every reading session extra cozy.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Unique Gift for Book Lovers:</strong> A thoughtful and personal gift that any book lover will cherish, perfect for showing off their love of reading.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Customizable Design:</strong> Make it truly special by adding personal details such as skin color, hairstyle, and name, creating a one-of-a-kind blanket.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Choose from Small (40x30 inches), Medium (50x40 inches), Large (60x50 inches), and X-Large (80x60 inches) for the perfect cozy fit.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Thoughtful Gift:</strong> Ideal for book lovers on special occasions like birthdays, Christmas, or simply as a heartfelt surprise for a fellow reader.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Comfort and Style:</strong> A beautifully designed, personalized blanket that adds warmth and style to any book lover’s reading nook.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Selected Size:</strong> This product is available in Medium (60\"L x 50\"W).</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> This blanket is machine washable for convenient cleaning.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Blanket</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fill Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>Book Lover Blanket 2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Book</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Letter Print</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>1 text input</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Special Feature</th>\n<td>Lightweight</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Size</th>\n<td>Medium</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Dimensions</th>\n<td>60\"L x 50\"W</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
